OL,3,GNEWSASwim teacher's 40 years of
OL,4,A'unwavering commitment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA swimming teacher of more than four
OL,7,Fdecades says she has "so many lovely
OL,8,Fmemories to look back on".
OL,10,FDiane Pape, 75, from Taunton in
OL,11,FSomerset, has been teaching generations
OL,12,Fof families to swim for 42 years at
OL,13,FBlackbrook Leisure Centre & Spa and
OL,14,FTaunton Pool.
OL,16,FPape's journey started when she taught
OL,17,Fher own children to swim aged four and
OL,18,Fone. She said she really enjoyed it,
OL,19,Fdecided to do it as a job and went on
OL,20,Fto see her former pupils bring their
OL,21,Fown children and grandchildren to her
OL,22,Flessons.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
