OL,3,GNEWSASwim teacher's 40 years of
OL,4,A'unwavering commitment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has since been crowned Swim Teacher
OL,7,Fof the Year by Everyone Active for her
OL,8,F"unwavering commitment" to local
OL,9,Ffamilies.
